## 已決定（grilling，不重問）

1. **CSSOM 為底**：模組用 `<style>` + `sheet.cssRules` 遞迴（`cssRulesDeclaring` 已證明的路徑），註解、`@media` 巢狀不再是 regex 問題。`paint-tokens.test.ts` 的 `paintTokenViolations` 與其三個 fixture 測試保留文字掃描（問題是位置與行號），只共用讀檔。
2. **位置**：`packages/core/src/theme/testing/stylesheet.ts`（+ `stylesheet.test.ts`）；`tsconfig.build.json` 的 exclude 加 `src/**/testing/**`；board 用相對路徑 `../../core/src/theme/testing/stylesheet` import，不加 alias、不開 package。
3. **讀檔**：模組提供 `readBeside(importMetaUrl, relativePath)`（`readFileSync(new URL(relativePath, importMetaUrl))`，呼叫端先把 `import.meta.url` 綁成 binding——index.test.ts 的做法與理由）；刪掉四處 `getBuiltinModule` 工作區法與過時理由；「`?raw` 會被 css-disable 改寫成空字串」這個仍為真的事實寫在模組 doc。
4. **三張票**：T1 模組 + 單元測試；T2 core 三檔改用 ∥ T3 board 改用（第二輪並行，各自 worktree）。
5. **斷言政策**：每個檔的 `it` 數前後相等、名字與意思不變；讀 body 的斷言改讀模組的 `cssText`（`prop: value;` 形式，既有 regex 大多直接可用）或 `declaration()`；全檔 regex 改 `selectsClass`。不跨 package 合併斷言集。

## Design contract（T1）

```ts
// packages/core/src/theme/testing/stylesheet.ts — test support only; never imported by src/index.ts

/** A file beside the test, read off disk. `importMetaUrl` must be a binding of `import.meta.url` (see index.test.ts's TEST_FILE_URL). */
export function readBeside(importMetaUrl: string, relativePath: string): string;

export interface Declaration { property: string; value: string; important: boolean }
export interface StyleRule {
  /** `selectorText` as the CSSOM reports it. */
  selector: string;
  declarations: readonly Declaration[];
  /** `style.cssText`: `prop: value; prop: value !important;` — what a body assertion matches against. */
  cssText: string;
  /** True when the rule sits inside an at-rule (`@media`, …). */
  nested: boolean;
}

export interface StylesheetOptions {
  /** `--siren-` for core, `--siren-board-` for board. */
  tokenPrefix: string;
  /** `:root` for core, `:where(:root)` for board: the one selector a token block may use (ADR-0014 / 01M3VYFBX). */
  rootSelector: string;
}

export interface Stylesheet {
  /** The text as read — for `<style>` injection and the few assertions on raw text (`@keyframes`, "no `data-theme`"). */
  text: string;
  /** Every style rule, in sheet order, at-rules walked; `@keyframes` blocks are not style rules. */
  rules: readonly StyleRule[];
  /** The one rule whose selector is exactly `selector`; `undefined` when none (throws when more than one). */
  rule(selector: string): StyleRule | undefined;
  /** Selectors of every rule declaring `property` (the old `cssRulesDeclaring`). */
  rulesDeclaring(property: string): string[];
  /** Whether some selector names `.name` as a whole class token (`.siren-box` is not covered by `.siren-box-background`). */
  selectsClass(name: string): boolean;
  /** Rules whose every comma-separated selector part is `rootSelector` — where tokens may be declared. */
  tokenBlocks(): readonly StyleRule[];
  /** Every `${tokenPrefix}*` custom property declared anywhere in the sheet. */
  declaredTokens(): Set<string>;
  /** Every `${tokenPrefix}*` custom property declared in `tokenBlocks()`. */
  rootTokens(): Set<string>;
  /** Every `${tokenPrefix}*` name read through `var(` anywhere in a declaration value. */
  referencedTokens(): Set<string>;
  /** Every `var(--name[, fallback])` read of exactly `name` (not a longer name), as written. */
  readsOf(name: string): string[];
  /** Colour literals (`#hex`, `rgb(a)(`, `hsl(a)(`) in declaration values of rules that are not token blocks. */
  literalsOutsideTokenBlocks(): string[];
}

export function readStylesheet(text: string, options: StylesheetOptions): Stylesheet;
```

- 實作：`document.createElement("style")` 注入、走訪 `sheet.cssRules`、立刻 `remove()`；`declarations` 由 `style.length` / `style[i]` / `getPropertyValue` / `getPropertyPriority` 列出。不得依賴 regex 去註解。
- `literalsOutsideTokenBlocks` 與舊法的差異（舊法掃整段 `outside` 文字，含 selector；新法只掃 declaration value）在 doc 說明；對 `default.css` 與 board CSS 兩者今天的答案都是 `[]`。
- `stylesheet.test.ts`：用 fixture CSS（含註解、`@media` 巢狀、`@keyframes`、`!important`、兩個 selector 的逗號、同名 class 前綴）覆蓋每個方法，先紅後綠；另對真的 `default.css` 斷言 `rootTokens().size === 30`、`rules.length === 124`（spike 量測的數字，模組可信的證據）。

## Design contract（T2 / T3）

- T2：`default.test.ts` 頂部改 `const TEST_FILE_URL = import.meta.url; const theme = readStylesheet(readBeside(TEST_FILE_URL, "./default.css"), { tokenPrefix: "--siren-", rootSelector: ":root" })`；`themeRules` 刪除；六處 class regex → `theme.selectsClass(name)`；`rules` / `tokenBlocks` / declared / outside / dangling → 模組方法；`ruleBody(s)` → `theme.rule(s)?.cssText ?? ""`；`:root` regex → `theme.tokenBlocks()[0]` / `rootTokens()`；`var(--siren-edge-march…)` 讀法 → `readsOf("--siren-edge-march")`；`cssRulesDeclaring` → `theme.rulesDeclaring`；dark theme → `readStylesheet(readBeside(TEST_FILE_URL, "../../../../demos/theme-dark.css"), …).declaredTokens()`；`renderThemedSVG` 注入 `theme.text`。`readme-tokens.test.ts`：`readText` → `readBeside`、`rootTokens(css)` → 模組（fixture 測試仍在）。`paint-tokens.test.ts`：`readText` → `readBeside`，其餘不動。
- T3：`styles.test.ts` 的四條 regex、`isTokenSelector`、`ruleBody` → 模組（`tokenPrefix: "--siren-board-"`, `rootSelector: ":where(:root)"`）；`:6-12` 的「share no test utilities」注解改成指向模組；「no `data-theme` / `prefers-color-scheme` / `@layer`」仍對 `text`（含註解）斷言。
- 兩票：每個 `it` 的名字不變、數量不變（`grep -c "^\s*it(" ` 前後相等，`it.each` 另計）、意思不變；若某個斷言在 CSSOM 下無法同義改寫，保留原 regex 並在報告說明。

## Test seams

- T1：`stylesheet.test.ts`（fixture + 真 `default.css` 的量測數字）。
- T2 / T3：既有 87 個 it 全綠 = ratchet；Suite 全綠。
- 本 board 不涉及 render 輸出，不跑 byte-identical harness。

## Non-goals

- 不動 `default.css`、board 的 `styles.ts`、任何 theme 行為。
- 不改 `paintTokenViolations` 的演算法。
- 不跨 package 合併斷言；不開新 package。
- 無 CHANGELOG（測試與 test-support）。

